OL,3,GNEWSAInquest hears of 'great danger'
OL,4,Atip-off before fire murders
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial workers received an anonymous
OL,7,Ftip-off that children were in "great
OL,8,Fdanger" days before they were murdered
OL,9,Fin an arson attack, an inquest heard.
OL,11,FDemi Pearson, 14, her brother, Brandon,
OL,12,Feight, and sisters, Lacie, seven, and
OL,13,FLia, three, died after petrol bombs
OL,14,Fwere thrown into their home on Jackson
OL,15,FStreet, Walkden, Salford, in the early
OL,16,Fhours of December 11, 2017.
OL,18,FTheir mother Michelle Pearson, 37, died
OL,19,Falmost two years later after suffering
OL,20,Fsevere burns.
